        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I have no complaints about the haircut, it was good, but the attitude made me feel uncomfortable and discriminated against, it is the first time they have made me feel that way in Canada, I feel really sad because although I came out with a nice cut, I basically came out Heartbroken by the bad experience, I don't think I want to recommend it to my acquaintances.",
